{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "24", "m": "08", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "04", "M": "33", "S": "14"}}, "news": [{"title": "Raidurg real estate rush drives record earnings for Telangana exchequer", "para": "Hyderabad Knowledge City has emerged as a vital financial asset for Telangana, recently generating over ten thousand crore rupees from land auctions. A standout sale featured an acre of Raidurg land fetching an astounding two hundred sixty-four crore rupees. The burgeoning IT sector has dramatically amplified the value of this prime real estate, while transparent bidding practices are ensuring competitive pricing and maximizing the state's revenue potential.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/raidurg-real-estate-rush-drives-record-earnings-for-telangana-exchequer/133451139?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-412700/133451139.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}, {"title": "Pay 10.8% interest to buyers for flat handover delay: Haryana RERA to Pyramid Infratech", "para": "Haryana RERA has mandated Pyramid Infratech to reimburse homebuyers for their delayed possession of properties. The developer is obliged to pay a 10.8 percent annual interest rate to four individuals involved in the Pyramid Fusion Homes venture. The authority rebuffed the company's claims regarding construction delays, emphasizing that conveyance deeds do not absolve them of their statutory duties for late possessions.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/rera/pay-10-8-interest-to-buyers-for-flat-handover-delay-haryana-rera-to-pyramid-infratech/133450907?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-50816/133450907.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "rera"}, {"title": "Gurugram: Eight years on, only 10% work done at OSB Golf Heights, homebuyers protest", "para": "After eight long years, buyers at OSB Golf Heights have taken to protesting against the stalled construction of their homes. Having invested up to 87.5% of the flat costs, they\u2019re dismayed to see merely ten percent completed after nearly three years of inactivity. With escalating EMIs, they are now appealing to government officials for a swift resolution and a definitive plan for project completion.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/gurugram-eight-years-on-only-10-work-done-at-osb-golf-heights-homebuyers-protest/133450871?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-183510/133450871.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}]}